 bhava nissita jantu metaṃ."},{"i":302,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"75","t":"Āpaccimattamabhinikkhamanābhiyogā,"},{"i":303,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Paṭṭhāya tampabhavato paripuṇṇa gehā;"},{"i":304,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Tvaṃ sabba jāti gahato api nikkhamittho,"},{"i":305,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Evaṃ janā bhava dukhā khalu nikkhamantu."},{"i":306,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"76","t":"Ekaggato pala tale nisitā cirandhi,"},{"i":307,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Dhārā sucittu sutale sati daṇḍa baddhe;"},{"i":308,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Nibbijjhi lakkhaṇa dhanuṭṭhiti santi lakkhaṃ,"},{"i":309,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Khittā tayonamanu vijjhatu jantu khittā."},{"i":310,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"77","t":"Tvaṃ pāramī jala nidhiṃ caturiha bāhu,"},{"i":311,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Sattīhi suttari ciraṃ janakova sindhuṃ;"},{"i":312,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Sampanna vikkama phalosi yathā casova,"},{"i":313,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Evaṃ janā viriyatapphalame dhayantu."},{"i":314,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"78","t":"Satta paradha dahanesu ciraṃ sudhantaṃ,"},{"i":315,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Khantī suvaṇṇa kata rūpa samantimattā;"},{"i":316,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Sabbā parādhamasahi tvaṃasayhamevaṃ,"},{"i":317,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Sabbe janāpi khamanena bhajantu santiṃ."},{"i":318,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"79","t":"Lakkhādhikaṃ catura saṃkhiya kappa kālaṃ,"},{"i":319,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Saccena suṭṭhu paribhāvita vācino te;"},{"i":320,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Vācāya sacca phusitāya samenti jantu,"},{"i":321,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Evaṃ visuddha vacanā janatā bhavantu."},{"i":322,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"bodytext","n":"80","t":""},{"i":323,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","t":"Ādinna dhamma mahiyatthira suppatiṭṭhā,"},{"i":324,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Dhiṭṭhāna pārami mahā vajiraddi tuyhaṃ;"},{"i":325,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Sattena kena pi yathāhi abhejja nejjo,"},{"i":326,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Evaṃ janāpi kusalesu adhiṭṭha hantu."},{"i":327,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"81","t":"Tvaṃ sabba satta cirabhāvita metta citta,"},{"i":328,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Toyehi saṃsamita kodha mahā hutāso;"},{"i":329,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Lokuttaraṃ taditaraṃ hitamāvahittho,"},{"i":330,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Evaṃ janesu janatā hitamāvahantū."},{"i":331,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"82","t":"Mittopakāra paṭipakkha janāpakāre,"},{"i":332,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Tvaṃ nibbikāra manaso cirabhāvanāya;"},{"i":333,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Pattosilābha pabhutaṭṭusu nibbikāraṃ,"},{"i":334,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Evaṃ janānunaya kopa nudā bhavantu."},{"i":335,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"83","t":"Sampanna hetu vibhavo tusite vimānaṃ,"},{"i":336,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Yuttaṃ guṇehi navabhippadavī vimānaṃ;"},{"i":337,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Tvaṃ vādhiparamidhirohiniyā tiloko,"},{"i":338,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Ārohatu bhaya sukhaṃ padavī vimānaṃ."},{"i":339,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"84","t":"Tvaṃverahaṃsi samabujjhi yathāca sammā,"},{"i":340,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Sampanna vijja caraṇo sugatosi hontu;"},{"i":341,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Lokaṃ vido purisadammasusārathī si,"},{"i":342,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Satthāsi bujjhi bhagavā si tatheva jantu."},{"i":343,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"85","t":"Saccitta bhū nidahitaṃ janatāya tuyhaṃ,"},{"i":344,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Kalyāṇavaṇṇaratanaṇṇavajātibhinnaṃ;"},{"i":345,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Dukkhaggi cora jalupaddutajāti gehe,"},{"i":346,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Tassā sukhaṃ bhavatu jīvitumāpadāya."},{"i":347,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"86","t":"Vācā vicitta vara tantu gataṅgi kaṇṭhe,"},{"i":348,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Svā mutta sagguṇa mahā ratanā valī te;"},{"i":349,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Vevaṇṇi yattani bhavaṃ sakalampahāya,"},{"i":350,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Hotañjanassa siri saṅgama maṅgalāya."},{"i":351,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"87","t":"Taṃ sagguṇatthava dahaṭṭha sutippanāli,"},{"i":352,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Nissandamāna guṇanīra nipāna tinte;"},{"i":353,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Khettetta saññini janā kata loma haṃsa,"},{"i":354,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Bījaṅkurī kusala sassa phalaṃ labhantu."},{"i":355,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"88","t":"Āpāyikappabhuti dukkha nidāgha kāla,"},{"i":356,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Santāpitā nikhila loka mano kadambā;"},{"i":357,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Taṃ vaṅṇa megha phusanā hasanaṅkurehi,"},{"i":358,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Iddhā bhavantu mati vallari vellītā te."},{"i":359,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"89","t":"Hetuddasā phaladasā samavaṭṭhitaṃ taṃ,"},{"i":360,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Sabbattha satta hitamāvahaṇena siddhaṃ;"},{"i":361,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Cintāpathātiganubhāva vibhāvanante,"},{"i":362,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Bhūtānamatthu caritabbhutamattha sidhyā."},{"i":363,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"90","t":"Aṅgārakāsumabhilaṅghiya dāna kāle,"},{"i":364,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Bhattattano pada paṭicchaka paṅkajā ca;"},{"i":365,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Yāt