tu ciraṃ janatā hitāya."},{"i":387,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"96","t":"Mārāri maddana hitādhigamaṃ karotā,"},{"i":388,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Bhatto tayā vara mahā jaya bodhi rājā;"},{"i":389,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Saggā pavavagga hitahetu janassa hantvā,"},{"i":390,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Sabbantarāyamiha tiṭṭhatu suṭṭhu sajjo."},{"i":391,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"97","t":"Sāmoda vaṇṇa bhajanī guṇa mañjarīyaṃ,"},{"i":392,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Cariyā latā vikasitā tava sapphalaṅgaṃ;"},{"i":393,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Okiṇṇa citta madhupe rasa pīṇayanti,"},{"i":394,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Sambhāvitā bhuvi pavattatu matthakehi."},{"i":395,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"98","t":"Sambuddha selavalayantara jānanavhā,"},{"i":396,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Nottattato tipathagā yati sāgaraṭṭhā;"},{"i":397,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Dhammā pagā suti vase tarite puṇanti,"},{"i":398,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Sambhāra sassamiha vattatu pacayanti."},{"i":399,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"99","t":"Paññāṇa kūpa sita paggaha vāyu gāhī,"},{"i":400,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Saddhā lakāra sahitā sati pota vāhā;"},{"i":401,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Sampāpayātu bhava sāgara pāra tīra,"},{"i":402,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Sappattanaṃ varadhane pati patti nāvā."},{"i":403,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"100","t":"Bojjhaṅga satta ratanākara dhamma khandha,"},{"i":404,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Gambhīra nīra caya sāsana sāgaro saṃ;"},{"i":405,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"So sīlyananta tanu veṭitha ñāṇa mantha,"},{"i":406,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Selena manthitavataṃ disatā mataṃ ve."},{"i":407,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"101","t":"Vuttena tena vidhinā vidhinā tato taṃ,"},{"i":408,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Laddhā nubhūtamamataṃ khila dosa nāsaṃ;"},{"i":409,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Accanta roga jaratā maraṇā bhi bhūtaṃ,"},{"i":410,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Bhūtaṃ karotu amaraṃ ajaraṃ arogaṃ."},{"i":411,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"102","t":"Saddhamma rāja raviniggata dhammaraṃsi,"},{"i":412,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Phullo dhutaṅgadala saṃvara kesarāli;"},{"i":413,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Saṅghāravinda nikaro samadhuṃ samādhi,"},{"i":414,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Sakkiṇṇiko disatu sāsana vāpi jato."},{"i":415,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"103","t":"Ānanda rañña ratanādi mahā yatinda,"},{"i":416,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Niccappabuddha padumappiya sevinaṅgī;"},{"i":417,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Buddhappiyena ghana buddha guṇappiyena,"},{"i":418,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Therālinā racita pajjamadhuṃ pibantu."},{"i":419,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha1","n":"104","t":"Itthaṃ rūpa guṇānukittanavasā taṃ taṃ hitā siṃ sato,"},{"i":420,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha2","t":"Vatthānussati vattita iha yathā sattesu mettā ca me;"},{"i":421,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gatha3","t":"Evaṃ tābhi bhavanta ruttara tarā vattantu tā bodhi me,"},{"i":422,"k":"anya-pajjamadhu-1","r":"gathalast","t":"Saṃyogoca dhanehi santihi bhave kalyāna mittehi ca."}]